#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.select.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.select"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.indexing.select.select_dispatch:1 of
msgid "Dispatch to select or select_expr based on argument types."
msgstr "根据参数类型分派到 select 或 select_expr。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.indexing.select.select_dispatch:3 of
msgid ""
"If the first argument is a :class:`LiteFrameExpr`, delegates to "
":func:`select_expr` to select computed columns; otherwise delegates to "
":func:`select` with the column names.  A single string argument is "
"treated as one column; multiple arguments are collected into a list."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.select.rst
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.indexing.select.select_dispatch:8 of
msgid ""
"Column expressions or column names to select.  Mixes are not supported: "
"if the first argument is an expression, all arguments are treated as "
"expressions."
msgstr ""
"要选择的列表达式或列名。不支持混合使用：如果第一个参数是表达式，则所有"
"参数都被视为表达式。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.select.rst
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.indexing.select.select_dispatch:13 of
msgid "LiteFrame containing only the selected columns, preserving row order."
msgstr "仅包含所选列的 LiteFrame，保持行顺序。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.select.rst
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

